\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. In our dear Lord's garden,
\par Planted here below,
\par Many tiny flowerets
\par In sweet beauty grow.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Christ, the loving Gardener,
\par Tends these blossoms small;
\par Loves the little lilies
\par As the cedars tall.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Nothing is too little
\par For His gentle care;
\par Nothing is too lowly
\par In His love to share.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus loves the children,
\par Children such as we;
\par Blest them when their mothers
\par Brought them to His knee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Jesus calls the children,
\par Bids them come and stand
\par In His pleasant garden,
\par Watered by His hand.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Lord, Thy call we answer
\par Take us in Thy care;
\par Train us in Thy gardden,
\par In Thy work to share.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

